<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="description" content="Mini Jogos: adivinhe a palavra secreta pelas pistas de direção e distância, e teste seus conhecimentos com perguntas e respostas."><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020"><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E🧭%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Mini Jogos</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{margin:0;background:#151515;color:#fff;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif}
body{min-height:100vh;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:env(safe-area-inset-top) 0 env(safe-area-inset-bottom)}
.app{width:100%;max-width:520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100vh}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 14px 6px;gap:8px}
.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.3px;color:#f7a600}
.coins{border:0;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:700;background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px 6px 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700}
.plus{background:#f7a600;color:#111;border-radius:50%;width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;line-height:1}
.packs{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:12px 0}
.pack{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#2d2d2d;color:#fff;border:2px solid #3d3d3d;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin:0}
.pack.on{border-color:#f7a600;background:#3b3017}
.pack span:last-child{color:#f7c600}
.warn{background:#3b2a10;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font-size:14px;color:#ffd27a;margin:8px 0}
.coin{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#f7c600;display:inline-block;border:2px solid #d9a400}
.btn{background:#1c1c1c;color:#fff;border:2px solid #f7a600;border-bottom-width:4px;border-radius:8px;width:40px;height:40px;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
h1{text-align:center;font-size:32px;margin:14px 12px 4px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.tries{text-align:center;color:#ddd;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:16px}
.cats{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 12px 10px;scrollbar-width:none}
.cats::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.cat{flex:0 0 auto;background:#2a2a2a;color:#ccc;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.cat.on{background:#f7a600;color:#111}
.catbar{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:0 12px 12px}
.catbtn{flex:1;background:#2a2a2a;color:#fff;border:2px solid #f7a600;border-bottom-width:4px;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.dice{background:#f7a600;border:0;border-bottom:4px solid #a97800;border-radius:10px;width:54px;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}
.cgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
.cgrid button{margin:0;background:#2d2d2d;color:#fff;border:2px solid #3d3d3d;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 8px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}
.cgrid button.on{border-color:#f7a600;background:#3b3017}
.cgrid button.rnd{grid-column:1/-1;background:#f7a600;color:#111;border-color:#f7a600}
.thead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;background:#3a3a3a;padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px;color:#ddd}
.thead b{color:#fff}
.board{background:#383838;min-height:270px;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
.row{display:flex;height:44px;border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:#454545;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #2c2c2c}
.row .name{flex:1;padding:0 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.row .dist{width:128px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.row .dist svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.c1{background:#4a8500}.c2{background:#e6a800}.c3{background:#cc5200}.c4{background:#b3261e}
.unk .dist{background:#d0d0d0;color:#222}
.win .name{color:#9be15d}
.ctrl{padding:12px 12px 6px}
.note{color:#ddd;font-size:15px;margin:0 2px 8px}
.pattern{display:flex;gap:5px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 10px}
.pl{min-width:22px;height:30px;border-bottom:3px solid #777;text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:30px}
.pl.sp{border-bottom:0;min-width:10px}
.inrow{display:flex;gap:10px;position:relative}
input{flex:1;min-width:0;background:#444;border:0;border-radius:8px;color:#fff;font-size:20px;padding:13px 12px;outline:none;caret-color:#f7a600}
input:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #f7a600}
.send{background:#e8a600;color:#111;border:0;border-bottom:4px solid #a97800;border-radius:8px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;padding:0 26px;cursor:pointer}
.send:disabled,.hint:disabled{opacity:.45}
.sug{position:absolute;left:0;right:110px;bottom:100%;margin-bottom:6px;background:#2d2d2d;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px #000a;z-index:5}
.sug button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:19px;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #3c3c3c;cursor:pointer}
.sug button:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.sug button:active{background:#444}
.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
.hint{flex:1;background:#1c1c1c;color:#fff;border:2px solid #f7a600;border-bottom-width:4px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;padding:12px;cursor:pointer}
.msg{margin:10px 12px 0;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;display:none}
.msg.show{display:block}
.msg.ok{background:#2c4a10;color:#c6f58f}
.msg.no{background:#4a1d1a;color:#ffb3ab}
.msg .again{display:block;margin:12px auto 0;background:#e8a600;color:#111;border:0;border-bottom:4px solid #a97800;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;padding:11px 24px;cursor:pointer}
.modes{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px 0}
.mode{flex:1;background:#2a2a2a;color:#ccc;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.mode.on{background:#f7a600;color:#111}
.qwrap{padding:0 14px}
.qcats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0 18px;justify-content:center}
.qcat{background:#2a2a2a;color:#ddd;border:2px solid #3a3a3a;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.qcat.on{border-color:#f7a600;background:#3b3017;color:#fff}
.big{width:100%;padding:15px;font-size:19px;border-radius:10px}
.qtop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ddd}
.qchip{background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:13px;color:#f7a600}
.qbar{height:6px;background:#2f2f2f;border-radius:3px;margin:10px 0 16px;overflow:hidden}
.qbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:#f7a600;width:0;transition:width .3s}
#qText{font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 16px;min-height:96px}
.qopt{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:#2d2d2d;color:#fff;border:2px solid #3d3d3d;border-bottom-width:4px;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.qopt.ok{background:#2c4a10;border-color:#4a8500}
.qopt.bad{background:#4a1d1a;border-color:#b3261e}
.qopt:disabled{cursor:default}
#qNext{margin-top:6px}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;top:70px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#fff;color:#111;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s;z-index:50}
.toast.show{opacity:1}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#000c;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;z-index:30}
.modal.show{display:flex}
.card{background:#242424;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;max-width:420px;line-height:1.5;font-size:16px}
.card h2{margin:0 0 8px}
.card .lg{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:6px}
.card button{margin-top:12px;background:#e8a600;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 20px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style id="theme">
:root{--bg1:#0b1020;--bg2:#1a1038;--ink:#eef1ff;--mute:#9aa3c7;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,.07);--line:rgba(255,255,255,.12);--acc:#5eead4;--acc2:#a78bfa}
html,body{font-family:"Outfit",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2)) fixed}
.logo{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
.logo::before{content:"🧭 ";-webkit-text-fill-color:initial}
.coins{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 8px 5px 6px}
.coin{background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#fff3b0,#f5b301);border:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px #f5b30166}
.plus{background:var(--acc);color:#0b1020}
.btn{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;color:var(--ink)}
.modes{gap:6px;padding:8px 12px 2px}
.mode{background:var(--glass);color:var(--mute);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;font-family:inherit}
.mode.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);color:#0b1020;border-color:transparent}
h1{font-weight:800;font-size:30px;margin:12px 12px 2px}
.tries{color:var(--mute);margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.5px}
.catbtn{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit}
.dice{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);border:0;border-radius:14px}
.thead{background:none;color:var(--mute);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;padding:6px 18px}
.thead b{color:var(--mute);font-weight:600}
.board{background:none;padding:4px 12px;gap:10px;min-height:260px}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;height:auto;padding:12px 14px 10px;gap:8px 10px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden;align-items:center}
.row .name{padding:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;display:block}
.row .dist{width:auto;background:var(--c,#555);color:#0b1020;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;gap:6px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
.row .dist .arr{font-size:18px}
.meter{grid-column:1/-1;display:block;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);overflow:hidden}
.meter b{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:var(--c)}
.row.unk{background:none;border:1.5px dashed #6b74a3}
.row.unk .name{color:var(--mute);font-style:italic;font-weight:400}
.row.unk .dist{background:var(--glass);color:var(--ink)}
.row.win{border-color:#34d399;background:rgba(52,211,153,.12)}
.row.win .name{color:#a7f3d0}
.note{color:var(--mute);font-size:13px}
.pl{border-bottom:2px solid #6b74a3;border-radius:2px}
input{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit;caret-color:var(--acc)}
input:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--acc)}
.send{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);color:#0b1020;border:0;border-radius:14px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:800}
.hint{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--acc);border-radius:14px;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit}
.msg.ok{background:rgba(52,211,153,.15);color:#a7f3d0;border:1px solid #34d399}
.msg.no{background:rgba(255,107,107,.12);color:#ffc9c9;border:1px solid #ff6b6b}
.msg .again{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);color:#0b1020;border:0;border-radius:14px;font-family:inherit}
.toast{background:var(--ink);border-radius:999px}
.card{background:#1a1d3a;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px}
.card button{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);color:#0b1020;border-radius:14px;font-family:inherit}
.c1{background:#ff6b6b}.c2{background:#ffa94d}.c3{background:#4dabf7}.c4{background:#5c6b8a}
.pack,.qcat,.cgrid button,.qopt{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-width:1px;border-radius:14px;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit}
.pack.on,.qcat.on,.cgrid button.on{border-color:var(--acc);background:rgba(94,234,212,.12)}
.cgrid button.rnd{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa);color:#0b1020;border:0}
.qopt.ok{background:rgba(52,211,153,.18);border-color:#34d399}
.qopt.bad{background:rgba(255,107,107,.18);border-color:#ff6b6b}
.qbar{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.qbar i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5eead4,#a78bfa)}
.qchip{background:var(--glass);color:var(--acc)}
.warn{background:rgba(245,179,1,.12);color:#fcd34d;border-radius:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Mini Jogos</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
      <div class="coins" title="Seus tokens"><span class="coin"></span><span id="coins">300</span></div>
      <button class="btn" id="helpBtn" aria-label="Como jogar">?</button>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="modes">
    <button class="mode on" id="modeList">🔤 Adivinha na Lista</button>
    <button class="mode" id="modeQuiz">❓ Perguntas e Respostas</button>
  </div>
  <div id="listView">
  <h1 id="title">Marcas de Luxo</h1>
  <p class="tries" id="tries">Tentativas: 0/8</p>
  <div class="catbar"><button class="catbtn" id="catBtn">📂 Categoria: <b id="catName"></b> ▾</button><button class="dice" id="diceBtn" aria-label="Aleatório">🎲</button></div>
  <div class="thead"><span><b>Seus palpites</b> · A–Z</span><span>Pista</span></div>
  <div class="board" id="board"></div>
  <div class="ctrl">
    <div class="pattern" id="pattern"></div>
    <p class="note">Os palpites ficam em ordem A–Z</p>
    <div class="inrow">
      <div class="sug" id="sug" style="display:none"></div>
      <input id="inp" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" autocorrect="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Digite um palpite">
      <button class="send" id="send">Enviar</button>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="hint" id="hint">Revelar Letra (−25 tokens)</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="msg" id="msg"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="quizView" style="display:none">
    <div id="qSetup" class="qwrap">
      <h1>Perguntas e Respostas</h1>
      <p class="note" style="text-align:center">Escolha uma ou mais categorias, ou deixe aleatório.</p>
      <div class="qcats" id="qCats"></div>
      <button class="send big" id="qStart">🎲 Começar (10 perguntas)</button>
    </div>
    <div id="qPlay" class="qwrap" style="display:none">
      <div class="qtop"><span id="qProg">1/10</span><span id="qCat" class="qchip"></span><span id="qScore">0 pts</span></div>
      <div class="qbar"><i id="qBar"></i></div>
      <h2 id="qText"></h2>
      <div id="qOpts"></div>
      <button class="send big" id="qNext" style="display:none">Próxima</button>
    </div>
    <div id="qEnd" class="qwrap" style="display:none">
      <h1 id="qEndT"></h1>
      <p class="note" id="qEndS" style="text-align:center;font-size:18px"></p>
      <button class="send big" id="qAgain">Jogar de novo</button>
      <button class="hint big" id="qMenu" style="margin-top:10px;width:100%">Trocar categorias</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:30px"></div>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
<div class="modal" id="catModal"><div class="card" style="width:100%;max-height:85vh;overflow:auto">
  <h2>Escolha a categoria</h2>
  <div class="cgrid" id="catGrid"></div>
  <button id="closeCat">Fechar</button>
</div></div>
<div class="modal" id="modal"><div class="card">
  <h2>Como jogar</h2>
  <p>Existe uma palavra secreta dentro de uma lista. Dê um palpite e o jogo mostra <b>em que direção</b> da lista alfabética ela está (seta) e <b>quantas posições</b> faltam até ela (número).</p>
  <p>Seta para baixo ↓ = a resposta vem <b>depois</b> do seu palpite na ordem alfabética. Seta para cima ↑ = vem <b>antes</b>. O “?” mostra o lugar onde a resposta se encaixa entre seus palpites.</p>
  <p><span class="lg c1"></span>🔥 quente &nbsp;<span class="lg c2"></span>morno &nbsp;<span class="lg c3"></span>frio &nbsp;<span class="lg c4"></span>🧊 gelado</p>
  <p>Você tem 8 tentativas. “Revelar Letra” custa 25 tokens. Você ganha 10 tokens a cada rodada que acertar.</p>
  <button id="closeModal">Entendi</button>
</div></div>

<script>
const LISTS = {
